**Pre-release**
  
- project version under development with exciting, new features -


Notes & To Do  
  
* send message to group has been added  
  
* audio notifications have been added  
  
* verbose server mode has been replaced with a QFile method, for the gDebug() method inhibits the storing of messages to file    
  
* previous version will get an error if socket is not used at all for several hours. A simple sendTextMessage "ping" on a hourly basis will fix this.  

* server maintenance messages have been added  
(ie. Server is going offline for maintenance in 10 min)
  
* ip region filter option might be added  
  
  
